# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only: present in the working copy, deliberately not in the repo.
# A clone should contain what's needed to run the project and nothing else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Runtime database. Created automatically on first run, and it holds real
# password hashes and auth tokens plus whatever the test suite writes -- none of
# which belongs in version control. Tracking it also made `git checkout --` on
# this path capable of wiping the auth tables, which has happened once.
backend/intake_sessions.db
backend/*.db
backend/*.db-journal
backend/*.db-wal
backend/*.db-shm

